[{"title":"重建羊侯祠和王原叔句","author":"贾黯","text":"古郡襄水阳，群山绕郛郭。\n其间岘首者，羊公最所乐。\n登临见洲渚，气象真磅礴。\n公乎既已没，高碑此镵凿。\n庙食有遗像，当时盛丹雘。\n到今仅千载，碑庙皆颓落。\n乔木荒榛间，庙址存依约。\n碑倒石屡易，文字免缺错。\n我侯至之初，亭庙皆新作。\n为诗道其意，风化思所托。\n侯慕羊公心，仁政及物博。\n将见襄阳治，与古相侔若。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60648,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"文旆山","author":"通真子","text":"魏氏当年礼斗坛，至今遗址在人间。\n苍梧已老烟霞淡，丹灶空馀岁月閒。\n铃铎夜深惊睡鹤，幡幢晴影上空山。\n后人自愧縻婚宦，不得追随款旧关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60649,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题多福院分翠轩","author":"郭三益","text":"平生但爱山中寺，此日来看竹外山。\n心境顿开清净想，客尘无复更相关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60650,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题南岳寺","author":"郭三益","text":"古木阴森梵帝家，帘泉一酌试新芽。\n官符星火催春焙，却使山僧怨白蛇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60651,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"流花亭","author":"郭三益","text":"面幽连野色，审曲带城闉。\n但见流花水，难寻避世人。\n蟠桃知几熟，藓洞谩长春。\n税驾追前事，踌躇要路津。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60652,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游日山","author":"郭三益","text":"洗光朝日上旋旋，瑞色分临此地先。\n门迥帆收江市密，山深龙卧海潭圆。\n静然柏子听幽偈，閒立苔痕问小禅。\n莫讶潮平归渡晚，斯游有意已三年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60653,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"韦羌山式公绿筠庵诗","author":"郭三益","text":"道人栖碧山，云居在空曲。\n十年海潮音，利物缘已熟。\n更寻妙高顶，超然具幽筑。\n古木插空青，寒筠抱岩绿。\n时携贝叶书，步入深林读。\n云衣冷萧条，静对含烟玉。\n客来境非喧，客去境自足。\n宵眠护禅虎，昼引衔花鹿。\n庵中三昧语，药我贪瞋毒。\n何当脱双凫，藜杖追高躅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60654,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题广度院","author":"郭三益","text":"羲和均四时，曜灵有急节。\n沈迷簿领书，坐叹春事歇。\n及兹新雨收，西郊轫初发。\n苍顽山气嘉，奔悍溪流活。\n风惊麦翻浪，水净秧抽发。\n渐穷萧寺幽，顿使烦襟豁。\n蜂喧酿蜜翅，鸟落啼林血。\n高僧日无事，种朮畦亩阔。\n绿苗已纾纾，紫花行复结。\n吾欲访长生，终岁期采撷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60655,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"郭三益","text":"举头语天公，慇勤推日车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60656,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"郭三益","text":"晓鸟啼哑哑，游子初去家。\n去家向何许，雪暗天一涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60657,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"澹山岩","author":"郭三聘","text":"忆昔游澹岩，文社四为侣。\n相逢各年少，抱负俱有素。\n训狐圣得知，夜半叫已屡。\n主人知客来，倒屣相告语。\n且言龙王神，多有灵异处。\n殷勤叩科名，吉兆齐确许。\n未成三先达，陆续霄汉去。\n转盼三十载，独我尚困沮。\n行将贾馀勇，犹幸有孤注。\n乘兴偶重游，寓敬香一炷。\n再拜问龙王，前约何可负。\n朱衣愿点头，成就在此举。\n拟欲镵坚珉，纪此一奇趣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60658,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游东禅院","author":"郭之义","text":"地去关城远，无人伴访寻。\n泉流溪路窄，石耸洞门深。\n紫翠烟岚懋，清凉竹树阴。\n重来应更□，□日解尘襟。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60659,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"首阳山行","author":"郭士道","text":"首阳山，青巃嵷。\n上耸紫盖凌瑶空，下周林壑盘苍龙。\n嵯峨自太古，崒嵂镇寰中。\n黄河西来绕其下，日夕云气开鸿濛。\n恍疑鬼神护，又似丹青工。\n诸峰不敢并，苍翠光玲珑。\n我生癖性爱山水，见此奇绝摩双瞳。\n忽忆武王收诸夏，夷齐叩马来山东。\n风云变化适际会，耻逐龙虎争奇功。\n归来守岩穴，郁郁抱孤忠。\n朝采山上蕨，暮拾山下蓬。\n渴饮涧中水，热眠云外松。\n既不学赤松子，又不侣商山翁。\n丹诚耿耿照白日，劲节凛凛摩苍穹。\n首阳青青万古色，不改夷齐之心胸，直与天地相始终。\n千载扶名教，二子功无穷。\n我歌首阳歌未歇，泠然八表生清风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60660,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"郭子正","text":"清晓开庭，茱萸初佩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60661,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"永遇乐","author":"郭子正","text":"多积阴功，后蒙天报，荣贵长久。\n一片灵台，丹青要画，画请看人间秀。\n慈仁雅着，延永松年，内鼎有丹方就。\n想除非，真的高人，五福自然兼有。\n从来义方，今见公辅，量运夔龙居后。\n承此门风，相传世业，都是经邦手。\n狂歌将意，知公难老，永助庆堂尊酒。\n有重重，腰金孙子，继来献寿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60662,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舜韶新","author":"郭子正","text":"香满西风，催岁晚东篱，黄花争吐。\n嫩英细蕊，金艳繁、妆点高秋偏富。\n寒地花媒少，算自结、多情烟雨。\n每年年妆面，谢他拒霜相顾。\n宝马王孙，休笑孤芳，陶令因谁，便思归去。\n负春何事，此恨惟、才子登高能赋。\n千古风流在，占定泛、重阳芳醑。\n堪吟看醉赏，何须杏园深处。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60663,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"村居","author":"郭仁","text":"移家杨柳湾，小筑田家坞。\n一宵春雨晴，满地菜花吐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60664,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"薇山书室为朱惟节赋","author":"郭仁","text":"幽意旷何许，逃名东海傍。\n卜邻惟拜石，览胜不赍粮。\n帙散兰亭近，书探禹穴忙。\n紫薇山畔月，流照有馀光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60665,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"分菊","author":"郭仁","text":"小畦香雨碧飔飔，分得新苗旋作篱。\n为待繁英供采掇，故寻异本斗芳奇。\n野人自爱编青障，老圃先教拥绿泥。\n浊酒预拚重九约，狂风莫损最高枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60666,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠梦英大师","author":"郭从义","text":"云水僧来说我师，换鹅书札转高奇。\n挥毫传下千年字，贞石曾留几处碑。\n混俗市廛人莫测，和光踪迹鹤应知。\n莲花结社须容我，不似陶潜爱湿卮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60667,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠何中立","author":"郭从周","text":"三字从来月正圆，一麾从此出秦关。\n钱塘春色浓如酒，贪醉花间卧不还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60668,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重华岩","author":"郭凤","text":"重华人逸夏商前，奚取名岩紫洞巅。\n深入才如窥寸管，仰瞻早已到中天。\n仙田有迹闲芳草，韶乐无声寄滴泉。\n遐想温恭游古昔，恍如瞻对听虞弦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60669,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舜庙","author":"郭凤","text":"云封舜冢杳难寻，徒取箾韶索九阴。\n学讲执中凭古籍，道传精一抱遗心。\n五臣山拱如班瑞，二女峰和似鼓琴。\n英爽不磨天地老，万年悲泪植篁琳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60670,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"郭凤","text":"遗响箫韶猺尚奏，啼痕湘竹泪新飘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60671,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"张王臣","text":"半落半开梅好处，似无似有草生时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60672,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题清芬阁","author":"郭世模","text":"视世轩裳一露萤，平生苦节抱遗经。\n卧云句好传弟子，钓濑名高齐客星。\n尚想臞儒在山泽，空留遗庙落丹青。\n发挥家传标潜德，奕奕元孙有典刑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60673,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长歌行","author":"郭世模","text":"若木无停阴，积石无还流。\n葵藿变旦莫，蟪蛄疑春秋。\n寸晷轻尺璧，神功宁九州。\n仰思坐待旦，礼乐隆成周。\n君子不可閒，努力崇嘉猷。\n当思竹帛载，不为鬓发羞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60674,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"念奴娇","author":"郭世模","text":"光风转蕙，泛崇兰、漠漠满城飞絮。\n金谷楼危山共远，几点亭亭烟树。\n枝上残花，胭脂满地，乱落如红雨。\n青春将暮，玉箫声在何处。\n无端天与娉婷，帘钩鹦鹉，梦断闻残语。\n玉骨瘦来无一把，手挹罗衣看取。\n江北江南，灵均去后，谁采苹花与。\n香销云散，断魂分付潮去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60675,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南歌子","author":"郭世模","text":"玉盏浮琼蚁，金奁吐翠虬。\n醉乡归路接温柔。\n暗卜幽期低约、笑藏阄。\n索去眉先锁，将言泪已流。\n小窗移火更迟留。\n自剔灯花油涴、玉搔头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60676,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"郭世模","text":"几点胭脂印指红。\n一双蛾绿敛眉浓。\n夜寒绡帐烛花融。\n剩炷龙涎熏骨冷，旋调银液镇心忪。\n整鬟羞顾半娇慵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60677,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝中措","author":"郭世模","text":"青灯听雨夜荒凉。\n归梦苦难长。\n坐想玉奁鸳锦，空馀臂粉衣香。\n枕边共语，窗前执手，帘外啼妆。\n也是平生薄幸，须还几度思量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60678,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑞鹤仙","author":"郭世模","text":"云阶连月地。\n记旧游、身在温柔乡里。\n花阴透窗绮。\n罗衾拥残梦，流莺惊起。\n银瓶水沸。\n待梳妆、屏风共倚。\n看情眉恨眼，宿粉剩香，乱愁无际。\n长记。\n多情消减，宋玉连墙，茂陵同里。\n离怀似水。\n天涯路，叹愁悴。\n想鸳机织锦，鸾台窥镜，秦丝幽怨未已。\n好归去、共把琴书，倚娇扶醉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60679,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑞鹧鸪 席上","author":"郭世模","text":"倾城一笑得人留。\n舞罢娇娥敛黛愁。\n明月宝鞲金络臂，翠琼花珥碧搔头。\n晴云片雪腰支袅，晚吹微波眼色秋。\n清露亭皋芳草绿，轻绡软挂玉帘钩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60680,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"隆庆府","author":"郭令孙","text":"翠壁苍崖万仞危，势如天险限坤维。\n山带岷峨千里秀，栈连秦汉两川驰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60681,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次曾端伯春日韵四首 其四","author":"郭印","text":"先生胸次艳千春，鬓绿颜红未老身。\n松柏岁寒终不改，谩随百草斗芳新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60682,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次曾端伯春日韵四首 其三","author":"郭印","text":"韶光荡漾眼双明，问柳寻花步屧轻。\n波暖浮鸥翻素影，风和幽鸟弄新声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60683,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次曾端伯春日韵四首 其二","author":"郭印","text":"谁言堤柳胜江梅，荣谢纷纷付酒杯。\n春去春归何足问，阳乌东出又西颓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60684,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次曾端伯春日韵四首 其一","author":"郭印","text":"瑞白春前已见三，向来膏雨物频沾。\n山城二月寒犹峭，生怕东风巧揭帘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60685,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又和 其一","author":"郭印","text":"披风擎露晓光寒，玉立霜阶照碧鲜。\n谁遣翩翩离海底，宝钗交映萃群仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60686,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又和 其二","author":"郭印","text":"湘娥故把玉钿留，能为幽人一洗愁。\n不似梅花枝干古，凋年寂寞暮江头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60687,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"万松岭","author":"郭印","text":"高岗立万松，晨夕鸣天风。\n法法如是说，应不负山翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60688,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"双清亭","author":"郭印","text":"水竹两奇绝，客来安此名。\n那知污秽里，识得是真清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60689,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水仙花二首 其二","author":"郭印","text":"隆冬百卉若为留，独对冰姿不解愁。\n谁插一枝云鬓里，清香浑胜玉搔头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60690,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水仙花二首 其一","author":"郭印","text":"琉璃擢干耐祁寒，玉叶金须色正鲜。\n弱质先梅誇绰约，献香真是水中仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60691,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"计敏夫送酒四壶有诗和之二首 其二","author":"郭印","text":"何须著意苦吟诗，未动毫端万景随。\n千载骚人还把手，谁云陶谢不同时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60692,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"计敏夫送酒四壶有诗和之二首 其一","author":"郭印","text":"万象森罗总是诗，神机一动即天随。\n寒梅把酒真游戏，妙意纵横十二时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60693,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兰","author":"郭印","text":"幽人纫为佩，不为香与色。\n秋菊暨江南，未可比君德。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60694,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冯当可游龙鹤山有诗赠安道人用韵二首 其二","author":"郭印","text":"君今宴坐澄神谷，万象之中能见独。\n功成白日上层霄，莫忘飞来两黄鹄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60695,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冯当可游龙鹤山有诗赠安道人用韵二首 其一","author":"郭印","text":"一到仙山眼自明，前身髣髴记曾经。\n真人眇曶在何许，更随藜杖缘青冥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60696,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"正纪见遗梅花云春信数枝辄分风月以助清樽而一樽无有也戏成两绝赠之 其二","author":"郭印","text":"风月怜君幸见分，老年春事正堪论。\n花枝照眼成惆怅，欲洗愁城欠一樽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60697,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"正纪见遗梅花云春信数枝辄分风月以助清樽而一樽无有也戏成两绝赠之 其一","author":"郭印","text":"水中疏影月中香，枯树前头独自芳。\n不有幽人时赏玩，谁传春信及寒香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60698,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"正纪诞辰辄成三绝句为寿所谓寿者非世俗之寿也盖期君道学坚固将与造物者游无终始者为友而已 其二","author":"郭印","text":"中冬蟾彩八分圆，可是人间诞谪仙。\n怪得心光吞万象，镌镵造化付诗篇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60699,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"正纪诞辰辄成三绝句为寿所谓寿者非世俗之寿也盖期君道学坚固将与造物者游无终始者为友而已 其一","author":"郭印","text":"复卦初爻寓意深，祗缘虚静见天心。\n君生正遇黄钟律，宜把真阳却众阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60700,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"正纪诞辰辄成三绝句为寿所谓寿者非世俗之寿也盖期君道学坚固将与造物者游无终始者为友而已 其三","author":"郭印","text":"岁月推来逢子午，坎离交处互乾坤。\n休将世法论脩短，超出阴阳道独尊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60701,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙渊二首 其二","author":"郭印","text":"爪牙了不露，谁能见其踪。\n超忽变化处，即此是真龙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60702,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙渊二首 其一","author":"郭印","text":"蛰龙道已成，升降得自在。\n渊无百尺深，窍穴通沧海。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60703,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再作云溪 其二","author":"郭印","text":"曳杖推门去，问讯西溪云。\n超然人境异，佳气日氤氲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60704,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再作云溪 其一","author":"郭印","text":"脩篁卫长江，云气自翔集。\n中有无心人，片云随出入。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60705,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再和 其一","author":"郭印","text":"月夕霜朝分外香，故将颜色占年芳。\n一枝赠我春何许，如在江南云水乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60706,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再和 其二","author":"郭印","text":"欲把群葩次第分，桃粗杏俗未应论。\n寒梢清绝世无比，且趁繁开倒绿樽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60707,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏投竹叶急流中","author":"郭印","text":"戏投筠叶赴湍流，颠倒纵横不自由。\n我亦江湖飘一苇，千波万浪信沉浮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60708,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有鸟褐色而羽如青锦解作诸般语一卒蓄之笼中颇拂其性俗名山和尚为赋一绝","author":"郭印","text":"锦作双翰褐作衣，雕笼蓄养亦多时。\n只缘学得千般语，欲返山林未有期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60709,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵刘文饶题绝尘亭诗","author":"郭印","text":"斜斜远树绕江头，十里平波似不流。\n更欲寻源穿窈窕，一蓑烟雨羡渔舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60710,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵当可观雪","author":"郭印","text":"天将瑞雪洒乾坤，世界浑疑色布银。\n人说丰年犹细事，边庭先喜荡烟尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60711,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵宋南伯梅花","author":"郭印","text":"天姿不与百花邻，枯木前头独自新。\n桃杏满川浑未识，犹将颜色斗青春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60712,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵邵公济寻梅三首 其三","author":"郭印","text":"天与幽姿自不同，凌寒独秀雪霜中。\n山茶未许方高洁，故使千花立下风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60713,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵邵公济寻梅三首 其二","author":"郭印","text":"独与幽人臭味同，细看诗句酒杯中。\n霜林万木无颜色，只有孤标傲晓风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60714,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵邵公济寻梅三首 其一","author":"郭印","text":"素艳遥怜月色同，暗香披拂有无中。\n一枝已觉春光破，不恨南邻笛里风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60715,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]